From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:09:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: retain native transaction IDs and signed mempool fee
 deltas

Structure the two existing Info diagnostics without changing missing-entry
returns, pool locks, finalization, priority accounting or snapshot publication.
Keep FormatMoney text as fee_delta and additionally expose its original signed
base-unit amount; use TxId rather than transaction serialization hash.
A real early-finalization native test checks the unchanged false return/empty
pool and actual JSON after flushing the logger. Real priority RPCs exercise
positive and negative increments on an otherwise empty fresh node. Native and
runtime validation are pending; no throughput benchmark is claimed.

